   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Clustering_Latest.csv - key findings\n\nGrain: workstream x L2 x store\n(2,236 rows, 0 dup keys)\n8 cols: workstream, l2_name, aur,\nquantity_sold, revenue, cluster_name,\nlabels, store_code\n\n2 workstreams: US 1,916 / Canada 320\n551 stores, 47 clusters\n5 L2 (~550 each) + Others 35\nlabels = cluster # in group (1-8)\nAUR 3/218/85; Qty 1/5,754/643;\nRevenue $4/$484K/$50K\n= store-clustering model output",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "findings",
   "originalText": "Clustering_Latest.csv - key findings\n\nGrain: workstream x L2 x store\n(2,236 rows, 0 dup keys)\n8 cols: workstream, l2_name, aur,\nquantity_sold, revenue, cluster_name,\nlabels, store_code\n\n2 workstreams: US 1,916 / Canada 320\n551 stores, 47 clusters\n5 L2 (~550 each) + Others 35\nlabels = cluster # in group (1-8)\nAUR 3/218/85; Qty 1/5,754/643;\nRevenue $4/$484K/$50K\n= store-clustering model output",
